  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="transcription" xml:id="transcription_aad_0175" xml:lang="en">
          <div type="letter">
        <pb facs="https://iiif.acdh.oeaw.ac.at/aad/aad_00526/" ed="1r" type="sheet"/>
            <div type="letter_message" hand="#type_black_gray">
              <opener>
                <dateline>  
                  <date>
                    <lb/><space quantity="26" unit="char"/>30 September l97l
                  </date>
                </dateline>
                <seg hand="#print_rmc">
                  <orgName>
                    <lb/><rs type="org" ref="#amp_organization_362">RMC
                    <lb/>RANDOLPH-MACON COLLEGE</rs>
                  </orgName>
                  <placeName>
                    <lb/><rs type="place" ref="#amp_place_id_28">ASHLAND</rs>, VIRGINIA 23005
                  </placeName>
                </seg>
                <salute>
                  <lb/>Dear <rs type="person" ref="#amp_person_1">Mr. Auden</rs>,
                </salute>
              </opener>
              <p>
                <lb/>Just a line to let you know you are on my mind. Last night I read
                <lb/>Loren Eiseley's THE UNEXPECTED UNIVERSE and when I read the chapter
                <lb/>"The Innocent Fox<unclear>"</unclear>, it made me think of you. I had just finished re-
                <lb/>reading PLASTIC SENSE. I still re-read at least one of your peoms daily.
                <lb/>I know quite a few my heart now. I suppose I mean 'by heart' in more
                <lb/>ways than one. I truly look forward to your FOREWORDS AND AFTERWORDS,
                <lb/>if I recall the title correctly.
              </p>
              <p>
                <lb/>I should suppose its getting cold there now. I hate to think of
                <lb/>you there without Chester. Perhaps he is there. If so, please give
                <lb/>him my love. I shall never forget my two days thre with the two of you.
                <lb/>Keep well and happy; remember its your duty to God.
              </p>
              <closer>
                <salute hand="#hand_blue_gray">
                  <lb/>Devotedly,
                </salute >
                <signed hand="#hand_blue_gray">
                  <lb/><rs type="person" ref="#amp_person_555">Bill Gray</rs>
                </signed>
              </closer>
            </div>
        <pb facs="https://iiif.acdh.oeaw.ac.at/aad/aad_00527/" ed="1v" type="sheet"/>
            <div>
              <ab hand="#hand_blue_unident_0175">
                <lb/>16
              </ab>
            </div>
          </div>
      </div>
    </body>
